==Description==
'''v1.65.0''' is the one hundred and sixteenth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 28th of May 2025. It added the [[Skills]] system, which introduced 17 new [[Skills]].

This update encompassed four versions, the main v1.65.0 update (released 28 May 2025) and three minor versions, the v1.65.1 (released 28 May 2025), v1.65.2 (released 28 May 2025) and v1.58.3 (released 28 May 2025).

