==Changes & Bugfixes==
===Towers===
*[[Warden]] cost increased from {{Robux|420}} to {{Robux|600}}.
*[[Pursuit]] cost increased from {{Robux|1,050}} to {{Robux|1,500}}.
*[[Gatling Gun]] cost increased from {{Robux|1,819}} to {{Robux|2,599}}.
*[[Mercenary Base]] cost increased from {{Robux|1,350}} to {{Robux|1,800}}.
*[[Engineer]] cost increased from {{Robux|1,687}} to {{Robux|2,250}}.
*[[Biologist]] cost increased from {{Robux|504}} to {{Robux|849}}.
*Fixed [[Medic]]'s ''Cleansing'' ability breaking when {{Color|CoinCrate|The Flea}} and {{Color|CoinCrate|The Beast}} [[Jester]] skins, [[Biologist]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Spring Time}} [[Cowboy]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Rocketeer]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Necromancer]], {{Color|EventMission|Ducky}} [[DJ Booth]], {{Color|Other|Mecha Bunny}} [[Cowboy]] and [[Swarmer]] were in its range.
*Fixed {{Color|CoinCrate|The Flea}} and {{Color|CoinCrate|The Beast}} [[Jester]] skins, [[Biologist]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Spring Time}} [[Cowboy]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Rocketeer]], {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Necromancer]], {{Color|EventMission|Ducky}} [[DJ Booth]], {{Color|Other|Mecha Bunny}} [[Cowboy]] and [[Swarmer]] not having ''Cleansing'' ability effects appear on them.
*Fixed [[Ice Turret]]s not despawning when their [[Elementalist]] was sold.
*Fixed [[Field Medic]] being able to protect the [[Missile APC]], [[Ice Turret]], [[Sunflower]], [[Ivy]] and [[Nightshade (Unit)|Nightshade]].
*Fixed {{Color|FallenMission|Fallen}} [[Missile APC]] missiles being collidable.
*Fixed {{Color|ColdFront|Stranded}} [[Medic]] animations and sounds at Level 5.
*Fixed {{Color|Spooky|Ghost}} [[DJ Booth]] particle emitters being visible.
*Fixed {{Color|Other|Bloxy}} [[Commander]] not having its sparkle particle effects.
*Fixed {{Color|Spooky|Spooky}} [[Crook Boss]] not having a muzzle flash at Level 5.
*Fixed {{Color|Jolly|Holiday}} [[Minigunner]] Level 0-2 firing sound.
*Fixed Level 5 [[Accelerator]] upgrade description listing an incorrect overcharge value.

