===v1.65.0===
{{UpdateLog|
{{UpdateBanner|SkillTreeThumbnail.png|Skill Tree}}
{{UpdateH1|📜Update Log:}}
{{UpdateH2|🌳New [[Skills|Skill Tree]] System!}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Customize your playstyle with our brand new [[Skills|Skill Tree]] system!<br/>Unlock skills as you level up to enhance towers, economy, defense, and strategy.<br/>Each category features unique upgrades with branching progression paths.<br/>New HUD: Refactored the in-game HUD to improve readability and clarity.<br/>[[Skills|Skill]] Icons: View your currently active skills in-game via new HUD icons.<br/>[[Index]] Changes: [[Rewards]] are now integrated with the [[Index]] to reduce menu clutter.<br/>[[Hidden Wave]] Changes: Having [[skills]] enabled now disables [[Hidden Wave|Hidden Wave]]!}}
{{UpdateThumbnail|V1.65.0Log1.png}}
{{UpdateH2|🔫Offensive Skills}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Enhanced Optics: Increases tower range.<br/>Improved Gunpowder: Boosts AOE explosion radius.<br/>Fight Dirty: Extends enemy debuff duration.<br/>Precision: Every X shots deal a 1.5x critical hit (non-stacking).}}
{{UpdateH2|💵Economy Skills}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Resourcefulness: More cash from selling towers.<br/>Bigger Budget: Start with increased cash.<br/>Stonks: Increases wave rewards.<br/>Scavenger: Double kill rewards every X kills.}}
{{UpdateH2|🎯Strategy Skills}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Accelerator: Reduces cooldowns for active skills.<br/>Scholar: Increases Logbook drop rate.<br/>Expanded Barracks: Shorter cooldown for spawning units.<br/>Re-enforcements: Raises the tower placement limit.}}
{{UpdateH2|🛡️Defense Skills}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Fortify: Boosts the player's health pool (uses highest HP in groups).<br/>Extreme Conditioning: Shortens duration of enemy debuffs/stuns.<br/>Beefed Up Minions: Increases summoned unit health.<br/>Over-Heal: Retain more HP from overhealing.<br/>Bandages: Automatically regenerate HP at the start of each wave.}}
{{UpdateH2|🔥Coming Up🔥}}
{{UpdateWhiteText|Hacker Tower<br/>...keep an eye on our socials for more info!📢}}
{{UpdateH1|🔨  Game Changes:}}
{{UpdateH3|Bug Fixes}}
*Fixed [[Elementalist]] towers not despawning when tower is removed
*Fixed [[Accelerator]]'s upgrade info text incorrectly stating for max level
*Fixed VFX for Bloxy [[Commander]] skin
*Fixed [[DJ Booth|DJ]] Ghost skin particle emitter blocks not being transparent
*Fixed max Stranded [[Medic]] not using correct animation
*Fixed max Stranded [[Medic]] having no sounds
*Fixed Holiday [[Minigunner]] having no sounds
*Fixed [[Field Medic]] incorrectly healing [[missile APC]] unit
*Fixed collisions on Fallen [[missile APC]]
}}



